        "description": "Returns the selected native owner status. A read-only timing annotation may explain a recent no-new-call-due check when every selected trial has a correctly issued, unexpired pending call and the next window remains non-due at both the owner check and current observation. The original text remains in owner_message. Missing, stale, invalid, ambiguous or due evidence preserves the owner warning. This read never starts workers, inserts calls or changes outcomes."
